                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "In this research we examined the relation between the psychological state of flow when playing a game of Tetris and cardiovascular markers of challenge and threat motivational states. The dataset consists of cardiovascular markers (HR, PEP, CO, TPR), task data (Tetris performance) questionnaire data (flow state scale) and background variables (demographics; personality)."
                },
